<?xml version="1.0"?>
<h:html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:h="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:jr="http://openrosa.org/javarosa" xmlns:orx="http://openrosa.org/xforms" xmlns:odk="http://www.opendatakit.org/xforms">
  <h:head>
    <h:title>Caregiver question (voice)</h:title>
    <model odk:xforms-version="1.0.0">
      <itext>
        <translation lang="en">
          <text id="yes_no-0">
            <value>Yes</value>
          </text>
          <text id="yes_no-1">
            <value>No</value>
          </text>
          <text id="topic-0">
            <value>Danger sign or emergency</value>
          </text>
          <text id="topic-1">
            <value>When to come to the clinic</value>
          </text>
          <text id="topic-2">
            <value>Getting to the facility</value>
          </text>
          <text id="topic-3">
            <value>Feeding her baby</value>
          </text>
          <text id="topic-4">
            <value>Something else</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/source:label">
            <value>Source</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/source_id:label">
            <value>Source ID</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/contact/_id:label">
            <value>Whose question is this?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/contact/name:label">
            <value>Name</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/contact/preferred_language:label">
            <value>Language</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/contact/other_languages:label">
            <value>Other languages</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/inputs/contact/parent/_id:label">
            <value>Household ID</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/consent_group:label">
            <value>Her question</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/consent_group/pilot_warning:label">
            <value>PILOT BUILD - NOT FOR PATIENT CARE. This module's clinical content has not yet been approved by a GHS clinical advisor. Use only for training and testing.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/consent_group/consent_note:label">
            <value>Ask her first. Record only if she agrees. If she says no, choose the topic and go on.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/consent_group/consent:label">
            <value>Does she agree to a short voice recording of her question?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/consent_group/question_audio:label">
            <value>Record her question (she speaks, you hold the phone)</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/consent_group/topic:label">
            <value>What is her question about?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply:label">
            <value>Reply to give her</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/en_emergency:label">
            <value>This may be an emergency. Go to the nearest health facility now. If you cannot travel, call your CHW or the emergency number right away.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/interpret_emergency:label">
            <value>There is no checked translation in her language yet. Give the English reply, interpreting it word for word. Do not add to it or change it.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/en_visit_date:label">
            <value>Your next clinic visit is on the date your CHW gave you. Please come. If you do not know the date, ask your CHW.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/interpret_visit_date:label">
            <value>There is no checked translation in her language yet. Give the English reply, interpreting it word for word. Do not add to it or change it.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/en_transport:label">
            <value>If transport is a problem, tell your CHW. Your CHW can help you plan a ride to the facility.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/interpret_transport:label">
            <value>There is no checked translation in her language yet. Give the English reply, interpreting it word for word. Do not add to it or change it.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/en_feeding:label">
            <value>For feeding questions, your CHW will help. Ask them to show you an approved feeding plan for your baby.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/interpret_feeding:label">
            <value>There is no checked translation in her language yet. Give the English reply, interpreting it word for word. Do not add to it or change it.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/en_unknown:label">
            <value>Sorry, I did not understand. Please call your CHW, or ask a family member to call them for you.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/interpret_unknown:label">
            <value>There is no checked translation in her language yet. Give the English reply, interpreting it word for word. Do not add to it or change it.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/emergency_action:label">
            <value>Danger sign: after giving the reply, do the Maternal danger assessment for her now (or the Sick child assessment for a child), and refer as it says.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/reply/pilot_reply_note:label">
            <value>These replies are PILOT wording. Give only what is written here. Do not add advice, doses or diagnoses.</value>
          </text>
        </translation>
      </itext>
      <instance>
        <data id="voice_question" version="2026092801" prefix="J1!voice_question!" delimiter="#">
          <inputs>
            <meta>
              <location>
                <lat/>
                <long/>
                <error/>
                <message/>
              </location>
            </meta>
            <source>user</source>
            <source_id/>
            <contact>
              <_id/>
              <name/>
              <preferred_language/>
              <other_languages/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
              </parent>
            </contact>
          </inputs>
          <consent_group>
            <pilot_warning/>
            <consent_note/>
            <consent/>
            <question_audio/>
            <topic/>
          </consent_group>
          <reply>
            <en_emergency/>
            <interpret_emergency/>
            <en_visit_date/>
            <interpret_visit_date/>
            <en_transport/>
            <interpret_transport/>
            <en_feeding/>
            <interpret_feeding/>
            <en_unknown/>
            <interpret_unknown/>
            <emergency_action/>
            <pilot_reply_note/>
          </reply>
          <data>
            <__topic/>
            <__has_audio/>
            <meta tag="hidden">
              <__patient_uuid/>
              <__household_uuid/>
              <__source/>
              <__source_id/>
            </meta>
          </data>
          <meta tag="hidden">
            <instanceID/>
          </meta>
        </data>
      </instance>
      <instance id="contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="user-contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="yes_no">
        <root>
          <item>
            <itextId>yes_no-0</itextId>
            <name>yes</name>
          </item>
          <item>
            <itextId>yes_no-1</itextId>
            <name>no</name>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <instance id="topic">
        <root>
          <item>
            <itextId>topic-0</itextId>
            <name>emergency</name>
          </item>
          <item>
            <itextId>topic-1</itextId>
            <name>visit_date</name>
          </item>
          <item>
            <itextId>topic-2</itextId>
            <name>transport</name>
          </item>
          <item>
            <itextId>topic-3</itextId>
            <name>feeding</name>
          </item>
          <item>
            <itextId>topic-4</itextId>
            <name>unknown</name>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs" relevant="./source = 'user'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/preferred_language" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/other_languages" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/consent_group/pilot_warning" readonly="true()" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/consent_group/consent_note" readonly="true()" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/consent_group/consent" type="string" required="true()"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/consent_group/question_audio" type="binary" required="false()" relevant=" /data/consent_group/consent  = 'yes'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/consent_group/topic" type="string" required="true()"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/en_emergency" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'emergency'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/interpret_emergency" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'emergency' and  /data/inputs/contact/preferred_language  != 'en' and not(false())"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/en_visit_date" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'visit_date'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/interpret_visit_date" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'visit_date' and  /data/inputs/contact/preferred_language  != 'en' and not(false())"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/en_transport" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'transport'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/interpret_transport" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'transport' and  /data/inputs/contact/preferred_language  != 'en' and not(false())"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/en_feeding" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'feeding'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/interpret_feeding" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'feeding' and  /data/inputs/contact/preferred_language  != 'en' and not(false())"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/en_unknown" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'unknown'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/interpret_unknown" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'unknown' and  /data/inputs/contact/preferred_language  != 'en' and not(false())"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/emergency_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/consent_group/topic  = 'emergency'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/reply/pilot_reply_note" readonly="true()" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/data/__topic" type="string" calculate=" /data/consent_group/topic "/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/data/__has_audio" type="string" calculate="if( /data/consent_group/question_audio  != '', 'yes', 'no')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/data/meta/__patient_uuid" type="string" calculate="../../../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/data/meta/__household_uuid" type="string" calculate="../../../inputs/contact/parent/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/data/meta/__source" type="string" calculate="../../../inputs/source"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/data/meta/__source_id" type="string" calculate="../../../inputs/source_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/instanceID" type="string" readonly="true()" jr:preload="uid"/>
    </model>
  </h:head>
  <h:body class="pages">
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/inputs">
      <group ref="/data/inputs/contact">
        <input ref="/data/inputs/contact/_id" appearance="select-contact type-person">
          <label ref="jr:itext('/data/inputs/contact/_id:label')"/>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent"/>
      </group>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/consent_group">
      <label ref="jr:itext('/data/consent_group:label')"/>
      <input ref="/data/consent_group/pilot_warning">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/consent_group/pilot_warning:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/consent_group/consent_note">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/consent_group/consent_note:label')"/>
      </input>
      <select1 ref="/data/consent_group/consent">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/consent_group/consent:label')"/>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('yes_no')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="jr:itext(itextId)"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
      <upload ref="/data/consent_group/question_audio" mediatype="audio/*">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/consent_group/question_audio:label')"/>
      </upload>
      <select1 ref="/data/consent_group/topic">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/consent_group/topic:label')"/>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('topic')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="jr:itext(itextId)"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/reply">
      <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply:label')"/>
      <input ref="/data/reply/en_emergency">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/en_emergency:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/interpret_emergency">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/interpret_emergency:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/en_visit_date">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/en_visit_date:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/interpret_visit_date">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/interpret_visit_date:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/en_transport">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/en_transport:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/interpret_transport">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/interpret_transport:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/en_feeding">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/en_feeding:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/interpret_feeding">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/interpret_feeding:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/en_unknown">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/en_unknown:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/interpret_unknown">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/interpret_unknown:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/emergency_action">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/emergency_action:label')"/>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/reply/pilot_reply_note">
        <label ref="jr:itext('/data/reply/pilot_reply_note:label')"/>
      </input>
    </group>
    <group appearance="hidden" ref="/data/data">
      <group ref="/data/data/meta"/>
    </group>
  </h:body>
</h:html>